const inflectionD=[D('diagnostic-false-candidate','Which polynomial has an inflection at zero?｜哪個多項式在零有拐點？','',['x²｜x²','x⁴｜x⁴','x³｜x³','x⁶｜x⁶'],'C',['minimum-is-inflection','zero-second-sufficient','correct','even-power-inflection'],'Check second-derivative signs.｜檢查二階導數符號。',["(x^3)''=6x", "(x^4)''=12x^2"],'A zero second derivative is only a candidate.｜二階導數為零只提供候選點。','choice-inflection',{},poly),D('diagnostic-slope-at-inflection','For x³+x, what is the tangent slope at its inflection?｜x³+x 的拐點切線斜率是多少？','f=x^3+x',['1｜1','0｜0','3｜3','Undefined｜未定義'],'A',['correct','inflection-horizontal','coefficient-only','zero-second-undefined'],'Use f″ to locate, f′ to find slope.｜用 f″ 定位，再用 f′ 求斜率。',["f''=6x§implies x=0", "f'(0)=1"],'An inflection need not have zero slope.｜拐點斜率不必為零。','choice-inflection-slope',{},poly)];

