 [C('Mechanism determines model｜機制決定模型','Fixed independent common-probability trials differ from finite sampling without replacement.｜固定次數、獨立且共同概率的試驗不同於有限不放回抽樣。','P(X=k)=§binom nkp^k(1-p)^{n-k}','A model is a claim about how data are produced, not just a familiar formula.｜模型是關於資料產生機制的聲稱，不只是熟悉公式。',['P_{HG}(X=k)=§binom Kk§binom{N-K}{n-k}/§binom Nn','E_{HG}(X)=nK/N;§ §operatorname{Var}_{HG}(X)=n(K/N)(1-K/N)(N-n)/(N-1)'],['Finite-sampling sizes are integers with 0≤K,n≤N; normal σ>0 and its second parameter is variance.｜有限抽樣大小為整數，0≤K,n≤N；正態 σ>0，第二參數為方差。'], 'Drawing every object gives a fixed count and zero variance; a binomial substitute would miss this boundary.｜抽取全部物件時數目固定且方差為零，二項替代會錯失此邊界。',['Mechanism diagram, exact mass table, support bounds and standard-score representation.｜機制圖、精確概率表、可能值界及標準分數表示。'])],
